{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31375","headline":"洋州于中丞顷牧左绵题诗越王楼上朝贤继和輙课四韵 · 刘璐","name":"洋州于中丞顷牧左绵题诗越王楼上朝贤继和輙课四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隔政代君侯，多惭迹令猷。\n山光来户牖，江鸟满汀洲。\n雅韵徵朝客，清词写郡楼。\n至今谣未已，注意在洋州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘璐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}